## Architecture

Vertical Slice architecture — each feature is a self-contained directory with all layers.

```
app/
  features/
    {{#each modules}}
    {{snakeCase this}}/
      {{snakeCase this}}s_controller.rb    # request handling
      {{snakeCase this}}.rb                # model / entity
      {{snakeCase this}}_service.rb        # business logic
      {{snakeCase this}}_serializer.rb     # JSON serialization
    {{/each}}
```

Each feature slice contains everything it needs: controller, model, service, and serializer. No cross-cutting layers to navigate — every change for a feature happens in one directory.
